          "test_procedure": "1. Identify all code paths where EIP-7702 Authorization tuples are processed and validated.\n2. Verify that ecrecover is called with the correct message hash (keccak256 of RLP-encoded authorization data).\n3. Confirm that the recovered address from ecrecover is compared against the claimed authorizer address.\n4. Attempt to submit transactions with Authorization tuples containing invalid signatures and verify rejection.\n5. Test edge cases: s > secp256k1n/2 (malleable signatures), r or s = 0, y_parity values other than 0 or 1.\n6. Verify that authorization rejection prevents any code delegation from being applied.",
